{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00031","headline":"初春登楼即目观作述怀 · 太宗皇帝","name":"初春登楼即目观作述怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凭轩俯兰阁，眺瞩散灵襟。\n绮峰含翠雾，照日蕊红林。\n镂丹霞锦岫，残素雪斑岑。\n拂浪堤垂柳，娇花鸟续吟。\n连甍岂一拱，衆干如千寻。\n明非独材力，终藉栋梁深。\n弥怀矜乐志，更惧戒盈心。\n媿制劳居逸，方规十产金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}